comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-18T15:37:46.481Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: inspected complete 2778-item all-status snapshot and searched published verification global skills. Existing release-health and prior MCP conformance lineages do not track caller catalog contamination. Current open and in-progress inventories checked before creation."
  "2026-09-18T15:38:53.176Z","harness:codex","TDD evidence: both published-executor success cases failed on missing isolated PM roots before the fix. All 40 verifier regressions and 26 sandbox-runner cases now pass. Every package subprocess including HTTP receives isolated PM_PATH and PM_GLOBAL_PATH with telemetry/Sentry disabled; strict protocol assertions unchanged."
  "2026-09-18T15:39:34.360Z","harness:codex","Real published verification now passes against npm/GitHub 2026.9.18 using empty registry credentials, isolated caches and isolated PM roots: npm metadata, npx/bunx CLI, stdio MCP, HTTP MCP and missing-binary negative controls all succeeded. Previous identical published artifact failed with inherited global skill pagination."
  "2026-09-18T15:52:44.825Z","harness:codex",Linked verifier run passed after serializing behind full coverage. An earlier linked run timed out waiting for the shared build-consumer lease while coverage held it; the verifier itself passed all 40 cases. Real registry acceptance and strict negative controls also passed.
  "2026-09-18T16:12:24.426Z","harness:codex","Final all-source suite passes 9011 tests and exact 100/100/100/100 coverage. Published release acceptance remains real registry evidence for 2026.9.18 and is distinct from the newly rebuilt candidate package, which separately passes installed npm/npx/bunx checks."
  "2026-09-18T16:58:44.833Z","harness:codex","Final-code packed npm/npx/bunx acceptance passes again after review corrections (nine bundled packages), using scratch outside tracker ancestry. Published-version stdio and HTTP acceptance and strict missing-binary controls remain unchanged. Hosted CI has exact global 100/100/100/100 coverage for this implementation."
